## Why This Is Asked

Tests for client-side file uploads with offline retry focus on realism, while remaining beginner-friendly by focusing on deterministic behaviors like chunking, offline storage, and privacy checks.

## Key Concepts

- Chunking and boundary handling
- Offline storage (IndexedDB)
- Retry/backoff strategy and idempotency
- Privacy controls in payloads
- Accessibility and cross-browser basics

## Code Example

```javascript
function chunk(file, size){
  const chunks=[];
  for(let i=0;i<file.size;i+=size){
    chunks.push(file.slice(i, Math.min(i+size, file.size)));
  }
  return chunks;
}
```

